      "rework_instructions": [
        "Fix `terminate_ac_from_init_returns_manual`: dispatching `CARA.Mode_Control_Algorithm.TerminateAC` from hot-start state `CARA.Mode_Control_Algorithm.AutocontrolInit` must transition to `CARA.Mode_Control_Algorithm.Manual`, not to `AutocontrolNormal`. Ensure Manual entry/during recovery then yields `CA_mode=0`, `software_control=0`, `alarm_signal=0`, `pump_fault=0`, `shared_buffer=blood_pressure`, `pump_speed=built_in_switch`, and `flow_rate=default_flow_rate`.",
